Keeps frontend/dist/ in the repository.

main.go embeds this directory with `//go:embed all:frontend/dist`, and that
pattern is a compile error when nothing matches — so on a fresh clone, before
`wails build` has produced index.html and assets/, even `go test ./...` fails to
build. .gitignore excludes everything here except this file for that reason.

`make clean` deletes the built output and leaves this file alone.
